{"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.06095406347283161,"c":1,"w":0.061728394826253252,"t":"Test 8","h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.86008230454541623},{"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728703,"t":"ВОВ:","y":0.10610465094201937,"w":0.037037035624186199,"x":0.082304527085026252},{"w":0.62980595906575521,"c":1,"h":0.017127041541505017,"t":"Well that's great. Now the trip I mentioned is just for a fortnight, but there might","x":0.1809733666031256,"y":0.10450885313983571},{"t":"be the possibility of leading other tours after that. Would that fit in with your","x":0.18098497781459694,"w":0.59687464396158862,"y":0.11952364351508282,"h":0.017235078575754348,"c":1},{"x":0.08202636785914684,"w":0.080807889302571614,"h":0.010698755441762242,"c":1,"t":"MARGARET:","y":0.1523195823838055},{"t":"ВOB:","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.080246913875149706,"y":0.18313953463387989,"w":0.037037035624186199},{"x":0.082129797293073847,"y":0.22964880036936464,"w":0.080613155364990224,"c":1,"h":0.0097641995433362938,"t":"MARGARET:"},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"x":0.082304526897069838,"y":0.24563953477180966,"w":0.032921810150146488,"t":"ВОВ:"},{"h":0.010174418787512463,"x":0.080246914428426255,"y":0.26017441834364685,"c":1,"w":0.080246912638346365,"t":"MARGARET:"},{"t":"That'd be fine. I'Ilbe free for five months. My job is due to start on October the","c":1,"h":0.016533386580935616,"w":0.62569117228190096,"x":0.18098653798997627,"y":0.15086001827165185},{"x":0.18090896708449974,"c":1,"t":"2nd, and I'm available from May the 1st until late September.","y":0.16500269006120605,"w":0.48388676961263022,"h":0.018200036353301141},{"x":0.18094845209403473,"t":"Good. Now is there anything I need to know about the food you eat? We usually","w":0.63605926513671873,"y":0.18093893952684492,"h":0.017554305607915821,"c":1},{"h":0.015838612375607575,"x":0.18303732592893215,"w":0.61949223836263023,"c":1,"y":0.19699043989717402,"t":"have one or two people in the group who don't eat meat, or have some sort of"},{"w":0.41975308736165362,"t":"food allergy, so we're always very careful about that.","y":0.21366279056313076,"x":0.17901234509461536,"h":0.014546867815428799,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.22819767425633675,"t":"Yes, I'm allergic to cheese. Would that be a problem?","x":0.17901233922077198,"w":0.42798355102539054,"h":0.01598837238037687},{"w":0.49204645792643231,"h":0.018475156229151746,"x":0.17887654426121136,"c":1,"t":"No, as long as we have enough notice, we can deal with that.","y":0.24268965424634947},{"x":0.1806910762504802,"c":1,"t":"That's great.","y":0.25855828883942966,"w":0.10157103220621744,"h":0.015060409078609172},{"y":0.23110465099073108,"x":0.83333333307346924,"w":0.028806584676106861,"t":"Q6","c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"t":"MARGARET:","x":0.080246913948316539,"c":1,"y":0.29941860456100855,"w":0.080246912638346352},{"t":"It sounds really interesting - would you like me to fill in an application form?","y":0.29664542033323538,"x":0.17893334023658591,"w":0.600987548828125,"h":0.016372376252119403,"c":1},{"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"x":0.080246913954222052,"w":0.034979422887166337,"y":0.31540697663674711,"t":"ВОВ:"},{"x":0.17887085948301082,"w":0.31092666625976562,"y":0.31243950990840208,"h":0.017431347333640712,"t":"Yes, please. Where should I post it to?","c":1},{"h":0.016621179659318752,"t":"MARGARET:","c":1,"w":0.09075476964314777,"x":0.078079405999194718,"y":0.32381150302882467},{"t":"Could you send it to 27 Arbuthnot Place - A-R-B-U-T-H-N-O-T - Place,Dumfries. Q7","y":0.3278744364219448,"c":1,"w":0.68534367879231772,"h":0.01706588506979434,"x":0.17481831507913276},{"c":1,"x":0.080246913945893616,"w":0.034979422887166337,"t":"ВОВ:","y":0.3459302324486242,"h":0.008720930389296333},{"t":"And what's the postcode, please?","y":0.342542994858544,"h":0.016588549731898272,"x":0.17681885501035016,"w":0.27188092549641929,"c":1},{"t":"MARGARET:","w":0.082304528554280595,"y":0.36191860456161296,"c":1,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.078189299403349302},{"w":0.084451713562011727,"h":0.014796523239081871,"t":"DG7 4PH.","c":1,"y":0.35888080812338896,"x":0.17896755876441314},{"w":0.037037035624186199,"t":"ВОВ:","x":0.078189301000370151,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.37645348826257763,"c":1},{"w":0.23662551879882812,"c":1,"y":0.37499999987670884,"h":0.013103651354534729,"x":0.17695473021054189,"t":"Was that P Papa or B Bravo?"},{"x":0.078189299400572496,"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.39244186036029816,"w":0.082304528554280595,"c":1,"t":"MARGARET:"},{"x":0.17641825305628767,"h":0.01399257017389488,"w":0.069425182342529285,"y":0.38974630773073182,"c":1,"t":"P Papа."},{"x":0.07613168804014947,"y":0.40697674404002604,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.039094648361206061,"t":"ВОВ:"},{"y":0.40523793391043617,"w":0.61128260294596348,"h":0.017395311586988704,"c":1,"t":"Got that. If you could return the application form by Friday this week, we can","x":0.17687567231395102},{"x":0.8312757196888928,"y":0.40843023238112486,"t":"Q9","w":0.026748971939086874,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1},{"y":0.42137809201195187,"t":"interview you on Tuesday next week. Say half past two. Would that be possible","w":0.63168726603190106,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054074,"x":0.17489710757075982},{"x":0.17487276655663128,"t":"for you?","w":0.070007553100585929,"y":0.43598780321777419,"h":0.014652299937146118,"c":1},{"w":0.082304528554280595,"x":0.076131686237263005,"y":0.45348837197323122,"t":"MARGARET:","h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1},{"t":"Yes, it's fine. You're quite a long way from where I live, so I'Il drive over on","x":0.17680344176119633,"y":0.45087001736867161,"w":0.5887451171875,"h":0.018756107671802913,"c":1},{"x":0.17695473570352069,"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"Monday. Should I bring anything to the interview?","y":0.46790341566191573,"w":0.3950617218017578,"c":1},{"t":"ВОВ:","x":0.078189300531922662,"y":0.48401162768836581,"w":0.032921810150146488,"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512463},{"t":"We'll have your application form, of course, but we'll need to see any certificates","x":0.17476123890486736,"h":0.018873983052931087,"c":1,"y":0.48165246379562554,"w":0.64017837524414056},{"x":0.17489711388644358,"w":0.47942387898763017,"h":0.016007204359074767,"c":1,"t":"you've got that are relevant, in cycling, first aid, or whatever.","y":0.49852767949978105},{"c":1,"h":0.010470007277489812,"x":0.07609558966448475,"t":"MARGARET:","y":0.51584057774284697,"w":0.08237672170003256},{"t":"ВОВ:","y":0.53052325568339043,"x":0.076131687614663116,"w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"h":0.016626228853726777,"x":0.17480169866798878,"c":1,"y":0.52848035920551784,"w":0.62366333007812502,"t":"And at the interview we'd like to find out about your experience of being a tour"},{"x":0.17483222211386967,"t":"guide, so could you prepare a ten-minute talk about that. please? You don't need","y":0.54467737535769845,"w":0.64212015787760413,"h":0.015766144922119363,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.0170954304392964,"x":0.17474875969340986,"w":0.44682790120442706,"y":0.55941334583113489,"t":"slides or any complicated equipment - just some notes."},{"c":1,"y":0.57690973042957483,"w":0.080309753417968741,"t":"MARGARET:","x":0.076100267224003912,"h":0.010424725158475812},{"x":0.076131687630490899,"w":0.034979422887166323,"t":"ВОВ:","h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.59302325570993464,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.017167727152506473,"w":0.37474169413248692,"t":"Right. I'll start thinking about that straightaway!","x":0.17476376914019084,"y":0.5747810396598223},{"x":0.17476601575565173,"y":0.59051272257294785,"w":0.58665059407552078,"h":0.018851091499463402,"c":1,"t":"Good. Well, we'll look forward to receiving your application form, and we'll"},{"c":1,"x":0.17283950809515544,"y":0.6074793877040392,"t":"contact you to confirm the interview.","w":0.29218106587727866,"h":0.013250883392226243},{"c":1,"t":"MARGARET:","y":0.62320270406950695,"w":0.08041590372721355,"x":0.07604719206620561,"h":0.010862033695719697},{"y":0.62209302311510506,"h":0.01453830777405285,"x":0.17489711656424931,"c":1,"t":"Thanks very much.","w":0.15637860616048174},{"x":0.074074074677618826,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.63953488361833621,"c":1,"t":"ВОВ:","w":0.037037035624186199},{"y":0.63808139521173313,"w":0.25925926208496097,"c":1,"h":0.014534883982160851,"t":"Thank you, Margaret. Goodbye.","x":0.17283950464608508},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.072016465204502111,"y":0.65253239086186043,"t":"MARGARET: Bye.","w":0.14197530110677084,"c":1},{"y":0.70200235587230919,"h":0.014567411690072918,"x":0.074074075853565666,"w":0.15432098388671872,"t":"SECTION 2","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.72939480001825752,"w":0.73273391723632808,"t":"Welcome to this podcast about the Sheepmarket, which is one of the oldest parts of the city.","x":0.071898407204819159,"h":0.019303518414356957},{"t":"As its name suggests, there was originally a market here where farmers brought their sheep,","y":0.74554060180227222,"w":0.73883361816406246,"x":0.073998383803825341,"h":0.016340862314608406,"c":1},{"t":"but now it's been redeveloped into a buzzing, vibrant area of the city, which is also home to","c":1,"y":0.76060882737859836,"h":0.018502611715184303,"w":0.72450083414713551,"x":0.071898123281575674},{"h":0.01763832892068562,"x":0.071931391999443886,"y":0.77632435245644571,"c":1,"w":0.72033116658528651,"t":"one of the city's fastest-growing communities. The nearby university has always meant the"},{"t":"area's popular with students, who come in to enjoy the lively nightlife, but now graduates","c":1,"x":0.069861959525349418,"w":0.7080282592773437,"y":0.7911480078870764,"h":0.019195051159538568},{"h":0.016866059409996303,"c":1,"t":"embarking on careers in the worlds of fashion and design are buying up the new apartments","x":0.069887585011874198,"y":0.80693079266896328,"w":0.73883641560872393},{"x":0.069893387262772153,"t":"recently built here to replace the small houses where the market workers used to live.","y":0.82321365433655769,"w":0.68327011108398439,"h":0.015777337958310045,"c":1},{"t":"The narrow old side streets are great places for finding original pictures. jewellery and.","x":0.069851086079876792,"w":0.68952443440755218,"h":0.017485796071334492,"c":1,"y":0.84541057271834241},{"x":0.069866235161430174,"t":"ceramics which won't break the bank, as well as local produce like fruit and vegetables.","y":0.86116257666675522,"c":1,"h":0.017836581972659138,"w":0.69979476928710938},{"y":0.87627183697949063,"t":"There's also lots of pavement cafes where you can have a coffee and watch tourists from all","h":0.017455224575226858,"c":1,"x":0.06987090541230799,"w":0.73473653157552077},{"y":0.79505813937645065,"x":0.8251028810525588,"t":"Q11","w":0.034979422887166378,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"w":0.037037035624186254,"y":0.84883720914116711,"t":"Q12","x":0.82510288126883968,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.034979422887166378,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"y":0.9345930230973809,"t":"111","x":0.87037037076449297},{"c":1,"h":0.016454192297478354,"x":0.39483721299237268,"y":0.96768258536995222,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.20824633280436194}],"h":3395}